WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.382
Step 3 reads the plan an
approver signs: its hash,

2
00:00:03.382 --> 00:00:07.825
and the two actions, a post that
creates and a patch that updates.

3
00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:10.868
The update's body holds the
status and nothing else,

4
00:00:10.868 --> 00:00:13.838
because Learn's patch
supplies only what changes.

5
00:00:13.838 --> 00:00:19.513
Step 4 runs the same repository on the
interim path, with deploy via set to portal.

6
00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:23.169
The same plan comes out, as a
sheet for the Defender portal,

7
00:00:23.169 --> 00:00:25.037
each rule with its file's hash.

8
00:00:25.037 --> 00:00:27.170
Delete what the lab made when you're done.
